The '''Rampage Cats''' (ネコ棒倒し, ''Neko Bōtaoshi'', '''Defeated Cat''') are a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appear in [[Sports Day Awakens!]]. They were added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Rampage Cats
|image = E 270.png
|appearance = [[Sports Day Awakens!]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3,160¢
}}

==Enemy==
Rampage Cats has unusually low health and damage for an Awakened unit. However, it has long range and area attack. It appears in gangs to make up for its individual weakness, so better kill them before they stack.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Sports Day Awakens!]].''

